{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0Ahoy, Captain! Welcome to Isle of Pirates!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The waves are calling you, the wind fills your sails! From a deserted island to an epic pirate paradise, will you have the courage and wit to lead the way? If your answer is <strong>&quot;Aye, Captain!&quot;</strong>, then you\u2019re in the right waters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather Resources!</strong><br>A sailor\u2019s treasure isn\u2019t just gold! Chop down trees, break stones, and collect materials! Remember, a strong pirate base needs a solid foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/0220_1_.gif?t=1743205232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Tavern!</strong><br>Every great captain needs a home! Use your resources to build an epic pirate tavern and spread your name across the oceans with every wave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/0221_1_.gif?t=1743205232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate Your Tavern!</strong><br>Pirates don\u2019t just swing swords; they love a good atmosphere too! Hang lanterns from the ceiling, pin ancient maps to the walls, or maybe make space for a pirate band? Should it be lavish, or more like a dark pirate lair? The choice is yours, Captain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Set Sail into the Blue Waters!</strong><br>There are unexplored islands on the horizon, lands that aren\u2019t even on the map! The helm is calling you, are you ready to explore? Remember, great treasures require great adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/0221__1__1_.gif?t=1743205232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore and Find Treasure!</strong><br>Old maps, forgotten ruins, and pirate legends\u2026 Find the lost treasure chests, grab the gold, and carve your name into pirate history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/0221__1__2_.gif?t=1743205232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand Your Crew!</strong><br>You can't sail the open seas alone, Captain! Find loyal crew members to join your journey, lead them, and etch your name into the annals of pirate lore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/022i\u00e7_.gif?t=1743205232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend Your Island!</strong><br>Don\u2019t forget, the seas are filled with more enemies than allies! Defend your island from tricksters, sneaky treasure hunters, and other greedy pirates! Strengthen your walls and prepare your cannons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/0221__1_.gif?t=1743205232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will Legends Speak of You?</strong><br>Will you be the one the winds whisper about, or will you write your own tale? Isle of Pirates is waiting for you, Captain! <strong>Hoist the sails, the adventure begins!</strong> \ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/0221__1__4_.gif?t=1743205232\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3456920?t=1743205232","background_raw":"https:/